<div id="S5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, in Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5.3 Further Analysis ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Integrating Text and Time-Series into (Large) Language Models to Predict Medical Outcomes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we compare the energy consumption and time of fine-tuning and inferring one of our models. This is particularly relevant if time plays a crucial aspect and limited hardware capabilities are available.</p>
</div>
